avz(){return new A.a96(A.b([new A.t9("assets/image/07953e58-09c8-4a50-94fc-a85133b283fb.jpg","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mena-safwat-98454a246_fullstackdevelopment-dotnet-reactjs-activity-7384887525447913472-1Nig/?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAADzy6PQB0rGsQY1YoIPxLAKZ9TjWQD1BxnM","As my capstone project, I built a complete Learning Management System (LMS) from scratch featuring: \n\u2705 Admin dashboard for course & instructor management \n\u2705 User-facing web application with advanced filtering \n\u2705 Shopping cart & checkout functionality\n\u2705 Secure authentication & authorization\n\u2705 Responsive design with Tailwind CSS\n\ud83d\udd17 Check out the live project: \ud83d\udc49 https://surl.lt/ujcxws\n","https://github.com/MenaSafwat7/algoriza-internship2025-FS99-FE-byway-user"),new A.t9("assets/image/798a362d-7ced-4842-aa35-098fbaa28993.jpg","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/peter-rafat_graduationproject-angular-dotnet-ugcPost-7347371921266593792-unY0?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAADzy6PQB0rGsQY1YoIPxLAKZ9TjWQD1BxnM","\ud83d\ude80 Graduation Project: AI-Powered Quiz Generator Website\nProud to share our project, has been awarded an A+ grade \ud83c\udf93\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfeb Teachers can:\n\u2022 Create quizzes manually like Google Forms\n\u2022 Upload PDFs to auto-generate questions using AI\n\u2022 Set up tests and share Room IDs with students\n\n\ud83c\udf93 Students can:\n\u2022 Join classes using Room IDs\n\u2022 Solve classroom quizzes\n\u2022 Upload PDFs to generate shorter AI-based practice tests\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Our AI generates:\n\u2022 Question Types: Multiple Choice, True/False\n\u2022 Difficulty Levels: Easy, Medium, Hard","ProjectModel"),new A.t9("assets/image/4aa86ec5-c638-4f52-ab40-11fa7a097071.jpg","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mena-safwat-98454a246_backenddevelopment-ecommerceapi-onionarchitecture-activity-7259678093852766209-EQdo?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAADzy6PQB0rGsQY1YoIPxLAKZ9TjWQD1BxnM","Architecture: Onion Architecture for clean, maintainable code\nTech Stack: ASP.NET, Entity Framework (Code-First approach), LINQ\nCore Features:\nData Seeding & Global Exception Handling\nJWT Authentication with secure token creation\nBasket, Order, and Product Services to handle e-commerce functionality\nGeneric Repository & Unit of Work patterns for efficient data handling\nSpecifications Pattern for flexible querying\nCaching to enhance performance and optimize resource use\nStripe Integration for seamless payments\nThis project taught me the power of clean architecture and the importance of authentication & authorization for security. It iss been challenging yet incredibly rewarding, and Iam excited to continue pushing my skills forward.","https://github.com/MenaSafwat7/E-commerce1")],t.gd))},
